      "title": "描述",
      "items": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "key": "description",
          "text": "Uploads failed for good when the network dropped for a moment. This retries them **three times**, waiting longer each time.\n\n- [x] Retry in `Client.Upload`\n- [x] Document it\n- [ ] Exponential back-off\n\n| Case | Before | After |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Wi-Fi drops 1 s | fails | uploads |\n| Offline | fails | fails after 3 tries |"
        }
      ]
    },
